m the center to the focus\nc = sp.sqrt(a**2 - b**2)\n\n# The radius of the circle is the distance from the focus to the point of tangency\nradius = a - c\nprint(radius)\n```\n```output\n2\n```\nThe radius of the circle is \\(\\boxed{2}\\).",
